direction: right
Subscriber: Subscriber {shape: person}
SubscriptionAPI: Subscription API {shape: rectangle}
Saga: Subscription change saga {shape: hexagon}
Plans: Plan service {shape: rectangle}
Billing: Billing service {shape: rectangle}
Entitlements: Entitlement service {shape: rectangle}
Notifications: Notification service {shape: rectangle}
Subscriptions: Subscription database {shape: cylinder}
Events: Subscription events {shape: queue}
Subscriber -> SubscriptionAPI: upgrade plan
SubscriptionAPI -> Saga
Saga -> Plans: validate target plan
Plans -> Saga: plan valid
Saga -> Billing: prorate and charge
Billing -> Saga: charge accepted
Saga -> Entitlements: grant features
Entitlements -> Saga: features granted
Saga -> Subscriptions: commit new plan
Saga -> Events: SubscriptionChanged
Events -> Notifications
Billing -> Saga: charge declined
Saga -> Plans: release reservation
Entitlements -> Saga: grant failed
Saga -> Billing: issue refund
Saga -> Subscriptions: retain old plan
